  "metadata": {
    "title": "Conformance DocumentType Beats Extension",
    "description": "A filled form deliberately stored with a .aprt extension. documentType is authoritative; the extension is a desktop affordance. A reader that infers the type from the filename gets this document wrong — and cannot work at all where no filename exists (an HTTP body, a database column, a clipboard paste, a share intent).",
